WEBVTT


00:01:26.747 --> 00:01:28.280
Weechana! Hey!

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:31.564
This is Pun! He was the man who saved Eva.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.840
I know.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.296
Do you have any problems with me?

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:44.320
Not yet, but I'm about to.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.170
Stop it! Both of you!

00:01:46.171 --> 00:01:47.749
Enough!

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.885
I should head out now.

00:02:03.907 --> 00:02:05.708
Can I talk to you?

00:02:08.776 --> 00:02:10.577
Follow me.

00:02:41.102 --> 00:02:43.504
The way you behaved made me look very bad.

00:02:44.275 --> 00:02:46.611
You're overreacting.

00:02:46.611 --> 00:02:49.064
You acted as if you didn't trust me.

00:02:51.054 --> 00:02:55.034
You didn't answer your phone,
and you were with him in here.

00:02:55.034 --> 00:02:59.819
Earlier, you raised your voice at me
right in front of everybody.

00:02:59.819 --> 00:03:02.726
I should be the one who gets to be angry.

00:03:03.851 --> 00:03:06.134
What if there were reporters around?

00:03:06.134 --> 00:03:08.027
You yelled at me first.

00:03:08.027 --> 00:03:09.584
You were harsh to me and yelled at me.

00:03:09.584 --> 00:03:11.084
Your behavior wasn't quite charming.

00:03:11.084 --> 00:03:14.384
I don't like it when you're alone with a man.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.984
What about you and Ginny?

00:03:18.984 --> 00:03:21.144
Is it okay if I reacted the same way?

00:03:23.107 --> 00:03:25.224
You went to see her in the United States.

00:03:25.224 --> 00:03:26.884
You had secretly been dating her
for six to seven months

00:03:26.884 --> 00:03:28.720
while you were still with me.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:30.613
How many times did you ignore my calls?

00:03:30.613 --> 00:03:33.544
You cheated on me
and did all those horrible things.

00:03:45.864 --> 00:03:47.099
I am dating you publicly.

00:03:47.099 --> 00:03:51.824
My family and the media know about us.

00:03:52.896 --> 00:03:55.472
That should be sufficient to satisfy you.

00:03:55.472 --> 00:03:57.419
What I did covertly is none of your business.

00:03:57.419 --> 00:03:58.998
Everyone does it.

00:03:58.998 --> 00:04:00.910
You are campaigning on integrity and loyalty.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.000
- Do you truly understand them?
- Shut up!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.470
Weechana! Hey!

00:04:09.896 --> 00:04:11.971
I chose to date you

00:04:11.971 --> 00:04:14.924
despite the fact that you're clearly
not good enough for me in any way.

00:04:14.924 --> 00:04:17.784
I had a feud with my family over dating you.

00:04:17.784 --> 00:04:19.667
Who asked you to do that?

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:21.291
Now, you can start dating someone
who is on the same level as you.

00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:23.744
Find a woman who is your ideal match.

00:04:23.744 --> 00:04:25.382
Make sure to inform her

00:04:25.382 --> 00:04:28.744
that you'll continue dating someone else
behind her back.

00:04:30.263 --> 00:04:32.064
Eva!

00:04:35.635 --> 00:04:38.182
I think we should end our relationship.

00:04:38.182 --> 00:04:41.944
Thanks for everything,
but I am done with you.

00:04:58.656 --> 00:05:00.246
- Hey.
- What?

00:05:00.246 --> 00:05:01.798
Can you drive somewhere else?

00:05:01.798 --> 00:05:03.600
Don't go home yet.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.864
I'm afraid he'd send someone
to meet us at home.

00:05:05.864 --> 00:05:08.096
Oh, come on.

00:05:08.096 --> 00:05:09.350
Are you sure?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.664
Yeah, just drive.

00:05:12.624 --> 00:05:14.425
Okay, fine.

00:05:22.675 --> 00:05:24.456
Hello.

00:05:24.456 --> 00:05:28.084
Can you help me conduct a background check
on a Thai living in New York?

00:05:30.456 --> 00:05:32.434
I'll send you the info.

00:05:33.571 --> 00:05:37.904
I want to know whether he used to
work at a particular restaurant.

00:05:39.854 --> 00:05:41.774
I need the report ASAP.

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.059
Good.

00:05:50.112 --> 00:05:52.075
Can you call Pun?

00:05:52.075 --> 00:05:55.704
Given what happened today,
I'm worried he might quit.

00:05:56.435 --> 00:05:58.206
Oh my goodness!

00:05:58.206 --> 00:06:01.144
Do you know him that well?

00:06:02.971 --> 00:06:05.264
He is not a "wannabe" type.

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:08.000
He is a genuine and trustworthy man.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.656
He is the kind of man
who solely concentrates on his work.

00:06:10.656 --> 00:06:12.406
He is more helpful to me

00:06:12.406 --> 00:06:14.144
than someone who lets jealousy
cloud his judgment

00:06:14.144 --> 00:06:16.884
while he's the one dating around.

00:06:18.558 --> 00:06:22.824
Do you think Weechana would accept
your decision to end the relationship?

00:06:22.824 --> 00:06:26.243
I'm worried he might exaggerate the situation
beyond what it should be.

00:06:26.243 --> 00:06:30.539
You can't get tangled up in any drama
for three months.

00:06:30.539 --> 00:06:31.689
Look.

00:06:32.454 --> 00:06:34.049
You didn't want to go back to your place.

00:06:34.049 --> 00:06:37.850
This is the first time
I've seen you this scared.

00:06:38.542 --> 00:06:40.544
What's on your mind?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.681
Book warned me.

00:06:47.864 --> 00:06:50.422
She said this family is intimidating.

00:06:50.422 --> 00:06:52.224
I need to be cautious around them.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:55.144
She also mentioned...

00:06:57.646 --> 00:07:01.864
that Weechai's mom disappeared
without explanation.

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:10.096
I heard on the news
that she fled the country, didn't she?

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:12.822
No, that was Weechana's mom.

00:07:12.822 --> 00:07:16.533
He keeps in touch with his mom,
and she is still around.

00:07:16.533 --> 00:07:19.670
Weechai's mom was the one who went missing.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:21.504
She completely disappeared.

00:07:23.336 --> 00:07:25.080
It's haunting.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.631
Do the daughters-in-law in this family
truly can't stay?

00:07:31.264 --> 00:07:32.619
I have no idea.

00:07:32.619 --> 00:07:34.891
That's why Book warned me to be careful.

00:07:36.344 --> 00:07:39.744
Have you ever asked Weechai about his mom?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.314
Why should I?
I didn't even want to look at his face.

00:07:48.019 --> 00:07:51.904
I will ask Pie about her.

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:53.875
I will send our makeup artist
to speak with Pie.

00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:57.403
In fact, she is Natasha Romanoff in disguise.

00:07:57.403 --> 00:07:59.424
I'll tell her to ask around.

00:07:59.424 --> 00:08:01.384
Yes, you do that.

00:08:01.384 --> 00:08:03.264
Go get them!

00:08:04.395 --> 00:08:05.686
Eva!

00:08:05.686 --> 00:08:08.345
Eva! Eva, where are you?

00:08:11.275 --> 00:08:13.584
We're stuck in traffic.

00:08:13.584 --> 00:08:14.998
I think I will walk home.

00:08:14.998 --> 00:08:17.875
No! You can't do that.

00:08:17.875 --> 00:08:19.731
- It's not far.
- Hey.

00:08:19.731 --> 00:08:22.888
I plan to spend the night at your place
to keep you company.

00:08:22.888 --> 00:08:25.674
You don't have to. I will be fine.

00:08:25.674 --> 00:08:27.864
- Oh, come on.
- I should go.

00:08:27.864 --> 00:08:29.584
Eva!

00:08:29.584 --> 00:08:30.734
Let me know when you get home.

00:08:30.734 --> 00:08:32.275
- Are you sure?
- Yeah.

00:08:32.275 --> 00:08:34.184
Text me when you're home.

00:09:14.763 --> 00:09:16.184
Pun!

00:09:17.424 --> 00:09:18.884
Ow, that was...

00:09:18.884 --> 00:09:20.603
- Pun?
- Okay.

00:09:20.603 --> 00:09:22.584
Eva.

00:09:22.584 --> 00:09:23.664
Are you okay?

00:09:23.664 --> 00:09:24.896
I'm fine.

00:09:24.896 --> 00:09:26.122
Thanks.

00:09:28.044 --> 00:09:31.064
I'm sorry I scared you.

00:09:35.171 --> 00:09:36.984
What are you doing here?

00:09:39.432 --> 00:09:42.358
I... I don't...

00:09:43.507 --> 00:09:45.405
I don't feel comfortable with Weechana.

00:09:48.174 --> 00:09:50.275
I don't either.

00:09:50.275 --> 00:09:52.135
But...

00:09:52.135 --> 00:09:54.270
He always acts that way.

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:56.504
Please don't take it personally.

00:09:57.726 --> 00:09:59.576
I don't mind him at all.

00:09:59.576 --> 00:10:01.098
I'm worried about you.

00:10:02.403 --> 00:10:04.512
You shouldn't allow him
to treat you that way.

00:10:11.056 --> 00:10:13.184
I'm here to let you know...

00:10:16.144 --> 00:10:22.576
that if he doesn't like me for any reason,

00:10:22.576 --> 00:10:25.544
you can replace me with someone else.
I'm okay with that.

00:10:26.464 --> 00:10:28.203
You've got a lot on your plate already,

00:10:28.203 --> 00:10:30.624
and I don't want to add to your problems.

00:10:34.038 --> 00:10:36.784
You're not the problem.

00:10:39.178 --> 00:10:41.504
Weechana is the problem.

00:10:45.235 --> 00:10:50.606
I think... Weechana will leave us alone
from now on.

00:10:50.606 --> 00:10:56.342
I believe...
our relationship is already over.

00:11:42.855 --> 00:11:46.529
I'm sorry again for scaring you.

00:11:51.795 --> 00:11:53.884
You should get some rest.

00:11:56.403 --> 00:11:57.784
Get home safely.

00:11:57.784 --> 00:11:59.292
Thanks.

00:12:39.024 --> 00:12:40.203
Yo.

00:12:40.203 --> 00:12:43.272
Welcome home, honey.

00:12:43.272 --> 00:12:45.081
What is wrong with you?

00:12:45.081 --> 00:12:46.984
I'm your housewife.

00:12:46.984 --> 00:12:48.958
♪ I'll save myself ♪

00:12:48.958 --> 00:12:50.664
How was your day?

00:12:50.664 --> 00:12:55.504
How was your boss?
Was she pleased with your work?

00:12:56.344 --> 00:12:57.740
Sorry.

00:13:02.139 --> 00:13:05.584
Did you know anything about Eva's boyfriend?

00:13:06.446 --> 00:13:09.688
Well, his family is wealthy.

00:13:09.688 --> 00:13:11.688
His father was a veteran politician.

00:13:11.688 --> 00:13:14.984
Eva's boyfriend has recently
become the new leader of his party.

00:13:15.659 --> 00:13:17.915
- Don't vote for him.
- Huh?

00:13:17.915 --> 00:13:20.438
Tell your friends not to vote for him,
either.

00:13:20.438 --> 00:13:22.464
What's wrong?

00:13:22.464 --> 00:13:24.224
What's going on?

00:13:24.224 --> 00:13:28.176
He waited for Eva at the gym,
and they argued.

00:13:28.176 --> 00:13:30.252
Then his bodyguards
tried to start a fight with me.

00:13:30.252 --> 00:13:31.744
- What?
- Yeah.

00:13:31.744 --> 00:13:33.446
Damn.

00:13:33.446 --> 00:13:36.099
You need to avoid confronting him.

00:13:36.099 --> 00:13:39.464
I heard he's brutal.

00:13:39.464 --> 00:13:41.763
I know. I'm not going to punch him.

00:13:41.763 --> 00:13:43.984
But he wanted to fight me first.

00:13:45.438 --> 00:13:47.027
Was he jealous of you?

00:13:47.027 --> 00:13:48.532
What?

00:13:48.532 --> 00:13:49.603
Me?

00:13:49.603 --> 00:13:52.451
Yeah, you're a good-looking guy.

00:13:52.451 --> 00:13:53.763
Come on, man.

00:13:53.763 --> 00:13:55.320
Okay, I know I'm good-looking.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:58.910
Besides my appearance, I have nothing else.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:02.799
If a man who has everything, as you said,
was jealous of me,

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:06.393
I think that was ridiculous.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:16.120
[Fit More Gym]

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.599
Good job.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.427
Pull harder, that's it.

00:14:22.427 --> 00:14:23.848
Let's go.

00:14:23.848 --> 00:14:26.547
Can you turn your body a bit more
so your waist is clearly visible?

00:14:26.547 --> 00:14:29.165
- One more time.
- I'm going to get cramps.

00:14:29.165 --> 00:14:30.865
That's right. Give me more.

00:14:30.865 --> 00:14:34.072
One more time.

00:14:34.072 --> 00:14:37.437
Should I get some photos of you in sweats
so you'd look hot?

00:14:37.437 --> 00:14:39.605
What kind of photos did the client request?

00:14:40.605 --> 00:14:42.787
I think we should get the ones with sweats,
just in case.

00:14:42.787 --> 00:14:45.325
I'll film two more clips, alright?
Let's get started.

00:14:46.048 --> 00:14:50.139
Hold on, I have to answer the phone.

00:14:50.139 --> 00:14:53.261
- Hello?
- Hey, I sent you a clip.

00:14:53.261 --> 00:14:56.307
It's about Weechana commenting on
Eva's viral running clips.

00:14:56.307 --> 00:14:58.851
What? What did he say?

00:14:58.851 --> 00:15:00.652
Okay, I got it.

00:15:05.059 --> 00:15:07.597
Did you see the viral clips
of Eva running with a hot guy?

00:15:07.597 --> 00:15:09.433
What do you think of them?

00:15:09.433 --> 00:15:12.445
Many people texted me the same question.

00:15:12.445 --> 00:15:14.520
He is Eva's personal trainer.

00:15:15.331 --> 00:15:19.325
Should I fire him for being too good-looking?

00:15:20.485 --> 00:15:23.065
Eva has faced some traumatic events recently.

00:15:23.065 --> 00:15:25.024
Have you discussed them with her?

00:15:25.024 --> 00:15:27.851
Recently, I've been mostly
concentrating on my work,

00:15:27.851 --> 00:15:29.312
which slightly upsets her.

00:15:29.312 --> 00:15:32.645
Eva has also been busy with her work.

00:15:32.645 --> 00:15:35.483
As most of you know,

00:15:35.483 --> 00:15:38.293
she's preparing for her role in a big film.

00:15:38.293 --> 00:15:43.005
We've always supported
and encouraged each other.

00:15:43.645 --> 00:15:47.712
I think I should find her a gift
to ask for her forgiveness.

00:15:47.712 --> 00:15:49.605
She tends to sulk easily.

00:15:50.765 --> 00:15:52.566
Sulking my ass!

00:15:54.951 --> 00:15:57.781
Hey, this is not good.

00:15:57.781 --> 00:16:01.259
A person who gets to the media first
can control the narrative.

00:16:01.259 --> 00:16:03.029
He spoke to the public this way

00:16:03.029 --> 00:16:06.845
to leverage social media
and keep you caught up in his scheme.

00:16:13.336 --> 00:16:16.445
Okay. We should start on page 11. Let's go.

00:16:22.984 --> 00:16:25.085
You can start with the first dialogue.

00:16:28.205 --> 00:16:33.096
If this is the role I've been given,

00:16:33.779 --> 00:16:36.809
then I'll carry it.

00:16:36.809 --> 00:16:41.011
Even if it hurts, I won't run from it.

00:16:42.365 --> 00:16:47.765
You don't have to destroy
yourself to prove anything.

00:16:48.877 --> 00:16:52.296
You don't have to destroy yourself
to prove anything to anyone.

00:16:52.296 --> 00:16:56.165
I think the script is about proving yourself
when it isn't necessary.

00:16:58.189 --> 00:16:59.990
Destroy?

00:17:01.395 --> 00:17:03.395
That word feels frightening.

00:17:03.395 --> 00:17:05.451
Are you alright?

00:17:05.451 --> 00:17:07.124
You seem very exhausted today.

00:17:08.808 --> 00:17:12.845
It's not about proof. It's about commitment.

00:17:13.605 --> 00:17:17.685
This is the pride of
becoming who I'm meant to be.

00:17:19.973 --> 00:17:21.965
Okay.

00:17:21.965 --> 00:17:24.784
Then do it for yourself.

00:17:24.784 --> 00:17:26.765
Don't do it for them.

00:17:28.037 --> 00:17:29.838
Not for the world.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:37.085
I am... and that's why I will stop.

00:17:38.341 --> 00:17:39.685
What do you think?

00:17:39.685 --> 00:17:42.216
Do you have any trouble with pronunciation?

00:17:42.216 --> 00:17:43.630
I'm okay.

00:17:44.435 --> 00:17:48.456
However, I still had trouble
pronouncing some words.

00:17:48.456 --> 00:17:50.125
I see.

00:17:50.125 --> 00:17:51.336
Take it slow.

00:17:51.336 --> 00:17:53.843
The more you talk to me,

00:17:53.843 --> 00:17:57.325
the better you'll get
at pronouncing difficult words.

00:17:57.325 --> 00:17:58.880
Okay?

00:18:00.637 --> 00:18:04.136
Alright, I think we should call it a day.

00:18:04.136 --> 00:18:06.435
But I need you to study your lines.

00:18:06.435 --> 00:18:10.008
They're on page 24, and they're quite long.

00:18:10.008 --> 00:18:11.809
- Okay?
- Sure.

00:18:17.226 --> 00:18:19.365
You're gonna be amazing.

00:18:20.011 --> 00:18:21.557
Trust me.

00:18:31.907 --> 00:18:33.261
- Hey, Pun.
- Yeah?

00:18:33.261 --> 00:18:35.571
Boat called and said
he'd be ready to work tomorrow.

00:18:35.571 --> 00:18:38.976
The doctor allowed him to work,
but he can't overexert himself.

00:18:38.976 --> 00:18:40.639
That's great.

00:18:43.365 --> 00:18:46.480
How is Eva's speaking skills?

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.000
She is very determined,

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.128
and she might be pushing herself too hard.

00:18:50.128 --> 00:18:53.205
But I'm sure she will ace it soon.

00:18:53.965 --> 00:18:55.952
I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:55.952 --> 00:18:57.133
Domino.

00:18:57.133 --> 00:18:59.464
- Yeah?
- Should we go?

00:18:59.464 --> 00:19:02.205
I don't feel like shopping anymore.
I want to rest instead.

00:19:02.205 --> 00:19:04.045
Sure, let's go.

00:19:04.045 --> 00:19:06.405
Pun, can we drop you off somewhere?

00:19:06.405 --> 00:19:08.771
Oh, it's fine. I think I will go for a run.

00:19:08.771 --> 00:19:11.171
Alright, you two should head outside.

00:19:11.171 --> 00:19:12.728
I need to pack up before we leave.

00:19:12.728 --> 00:19:15.405
- Okay.
- I'll be right there.

00:19:29.365 --> 00:19:30.688
Whoa.

00:19:34.128 --> 00:19:35.929
See you later.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.325
I'm sorry for everything.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:22.605
Why do you give me a car?

00:20:27.565 --> 00:20:29.528
Can you give me another chance?

00:20:29.528 --> 00:20:31.076
Weechana.

00:20:31.944 --> 00:20:34.227
I didn't end our relationship out of anger

00:20:34.227 --> 00:20:36.616
or simply because I was "sulky".

00:20:36.616 --> 00:20:39.443
I can't accept
that you cheated on me with Ginny or anyone else.

00:20:39.443 --> 00:20:41.795
Come on, it was just sex.

00:20:41.795 --> 00:20:43.645
Others around me did it,
so I had to do it to blend in.

00:20:43.645 --> 00:20:45.176
It felt inevitable for me.

00:20:45.176 --> 00:20:46.917
But I have a choice.

00:20:46.917 --> 00:20:49.099
This is a big problem for me.

00:20:49.099 --> 00:20:52.523
I expect you
to show me both love and loyalty.

00:20:52.523 --> 00:20:54.625
I might not have explained it to you clearly
the other day

00:20:54.625 --> 00:20:56.637
because you seemed
to misunderstand the entire thing.

00:20:58.779 --> 00:21:01.163
I also got hurt,

00:21:01.163 --> 00:21:04.045
but this is for the best.

00:21:04.045 --> 00:21:07.525
At least, we can still be friends.

00:21:10.067 --> 00:21:12.085
What about my campaign?

00:21:13.512 --> 00:21:15.780
You can still help me with it, can't you?

00:21:21.056 --> 00:21:23.963
I mean it's not all about the campaign.

00:21:23.963 --> 00:21:25.437
At least I'll get to see you around.

00:21:25.437 --> 00:21:28.043
It'll give me another chance
to improve myself

00:21:28.043 --> 00:21:31.455
and show you that I'm committed to you

00:21:31.455 --> 00:21:33.483
and that I don't want
our relationship to end.

00:21:33.483 --> 00:21:35.645
I know it is hard for you to believe me.

00:21:36.709 --> 00:21:39.805
I also want to discuss it with you.

00:21:41.061 --> 00:21:42.555
You're putting me in a difficult position

00:21:42.555 --> 00:21:46.112
if your party continues to promote us
as a couple.

00:21:46.112 --> 00:21:48.064
Could you ask them to focus on other areas?

00:21:48.064 --> 00:21:49.320
No, I can't do that.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:51.755
But we're not together anymore.
You can't deceive people like that.

00:21:51.755 --> 00:21:53.805
You can't break up with me.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:57.069
You're not the only important person here.

00:21:57.069 --> 00:22:00.493
You're not the only one
with a reputation to uphold.

00:22:00.493 --> 00:22:01.880
Wasn't I the one

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.739
who helped you become
a top-tier actress like this?

00:22:04.739 --> 00:22:07.629
I have agreed to serve as your accessory
in this industry.

00:22:07.629 --> 00:22:10.128
And I have agreed to be your supporter
for a long time.

00:22:10.128 --> 00:22:12.128
What's the problem with that?

00:22:12.128 --> 00:22:15.344
It wasn't a total loss to be beside me,
was it?

00:22:15.344 --> 00:22:17.685
- You were merely a food vendor.
- Hey!

00:22:21.069 --> 00:22:25.277
Everything was calculated.

00:22:25.277 --> 00:22:28.707
You've already benefited greatly
from dating me.

00:22:28.707 --> 00:22:32.045
Don't be too delicate to get involved
in my scandal.

00:22:35.451 --> 00:22:38.031
You can't break up with me right now.

00:22:38.805 --> 00:22:42.640
I've dedicated my entire
annual promotional budget to this car.

00:22:42.640 --> 00:22:44.032
You need to help me with my campaign.

00:22:44.032 --> 00:22:47.005
And you need to drive the damn car!

00:22:50.576 --> 00:22:54.045
Drive the car, and post it on your Instagram.

00:22:55.232 --> 00:22:57.685
You can't break up with me, no matter what.

00:23:14.285 --> 00:23:17.485
I'll have someone handle
the security camera footage tomorrow.

00:23:18.984 --> 00:23:22.936
We have been arguing since yesterday.

00:23:25.427 --> 00:23:29.793
You have to post photos of yourself
with this car tomorrow.

00:23:34.283 --> 00:23:36.418
I'll text you a caption to go with it,

00:23:37.333 --> 00:23:39.905
as well as your schedule for my campaign.

00:24:12.635 --> 00:24:14.765
It's going to be okay.

00:24:19.088 --> 00:24:20.889
There, there.

00:24:26.347 --> 00:24:27.733
The person you requested
a background check on

00:24:27.733 --> 00:24:29.907
did indeed work at the restaurant.

00:24:29.907 --> 00:24:34.312
He had worked there for eight months,
and he was fired on July 14.

00:24:34.312 --> 00:24:38.008
On July 22, he flew back to Bangkok.

00:24:38.008 --> 00:24:39.581
He has no family

00:24:39.581 --> 00:24:42.325
and relocated to the United States
with his uncle at 16.

00:24:43.736 --> 00:24:46.504
What about the security cameras
behind the restaurant?

00:24:46.504 --> 00:24:49.491
Don't worry about it.
It has been more than 90 days.

00:24:49.491 --> 00:24:52.320
There will be no records of anyone.

00:24:53.192 --> 00:24:55.432
He returned to Thailand on July 22.

00:24:55.432 --> 00:24:58.003
The award ceremony was held in mid-September.

00:24:58.003 --> 00:25:00.379
Following that,
he had a job interview with Eva.

00:25:00.379 --> 00:25:02.789
That was when he encountered Ginny's stalker.

00:25:02.789 --> 00:25:06.285
We checked thoroughly,
and there was no connection between them.

00:25:07.467 --> 00:25:11.003
Don't you think
it was such a strange coincidence?

00:25:12.213 --> 00:25:15.467
Even if he saw your face at the time,

00:25:15.467 --> 00:25:17.744
I doubt he'd remember who you are.

00:25:17.744 --> 00:25:19.479
He grew up there,

00:25:19.480 --> 00:25:20.840
and I don't think
he'd recognize many Thai celebrities.

00:25:20.840 --> 00:25:24.010
Also, I see no reason
for him to tell Eva about you,

00:25:24.010 --> 00:25:25.869
as it wouldn't benefit him in any way.

00:25:25.869 --> 00:25:29.005
Well, I'm already frustrated with this.

00:25:29.005 --> 00:25:33.110
I see.
Is there anything else you'd like me to do?

00:25:33.110 --> 00:25:34.392
No need to.

00:25:35.199 --> 00:25:37.000
I'll handle this on my own.

00:26:00.166 --> 00:26:01.621
Hey.

00:26:02.723 --> 00:26:06.565
You should clean up your face
and take some pictures to post for him.

00:26:10.781 --> 00:26:13.925
Can you take photos of flowers
and tag him in them?

00:28:39.512 --> 00:28:40.584
What?

00:28:40.584 --> 00:28:42.385
You need to see this.

00:28:44.709 --> 00:28:48.555
"I guess I am not mad anymore."

00:28:48.555 --> 00:28:50.445
- What?
- Look at this.

00:28:50.445 --> 00:28:52.845
Whoa!

00:28:52.845 --> 00:28:55.085
That says a lot.

00:28:56.704 --> 00:28:58.555
I can't believe it.

00:28:58.555 --> 00:29:00.509
Oh gosh!

00:29:00.509 --> 00:29:04.235
We nearly looked like a couple of clowns
for being mad at her boyfriend.

00:29:04.235 --> 00:29:08.045
I don't think so.
She seemed very upset after they argued.

00:29:08.045 --> 00:29:11.216
He didn't bring a car
for her that day, did he?

00:29:11.216 --> 00:29:13.835
- I guess you're right.
- See?

00:29:13.835 --> 00:29:18.165
Okay, then.
Well, it's a happy ending, I guess.

00:29:18.165 --> 00:29:20.885
- Our work will definitely go smoothly today.
- I really hope so.

00:29:20.885 --> 00:29:24.251
It's good that they finally reconciled.

00:29:24.251 --> 00:29:26.725
I hope no one picks a fight with me anymore.

00:29:26.725 --> 00:29:28.765
Sounds like a good day to me.

00:29:29.851 --> 00:29:31.045
Oh my goodness!

00:29:31.045 --> 00:29:32.721
Seems like it takes a lot of money

00:29:32.721 --> 00:29:34.999
to get back together with girls these days.

00:29:34.999 --> 00:29:38.765
I suppose I might not
get a girlfriend after all.

00:29:48.192 --> 00:29:50.483
If I were her, I would also forgive him.

00:29:50.483 --> 00:29:52.185
I wish Weechana were my boyfriend

00:29:52.185 --> 00:29:53.477
so I could be sulky at least ten times a day.

00:29:53.477 --> 00:29:55.200
A perfect make-up gift.

00:29:55.200 --> 00:29:57.001
Happy ending.

00:29:58.110 --> 00:29:59.920
Look at the comments.

00:29:59.920 --> 00:30:02.309
I'm such a material girl about this.

00:30:02.309 --> 00:30:05.285
And he sent me the cheesiest caption to use.

00:30:08.709 --> 00:30:10.342
I know.

00:30:10.342 --> 00:30:12.864
But many men left good comments on it.

00:30:12.864 --> 00:30:14.965
These could be bot comments.

00:30:15.744 --> 00:30:20.715
I checked. Most of them are your fans,
including your female fans.

00:30:20.715 --> 00:30:22.752
As you mentioned earlier,

00:30:22.752 --> 00:30:24.816
he used social media to control me.

00:30:25.877 --> 00:30:28.864
You need to help him with his campaign.

00:30:28.864 --> 00:30:31.515
People will see that you're still dating him.

00:30:31.515 --> 00:30:33.152
Even if you two broke up,

00:30:33.152 --> 00:30:36.149
others might still think
you two are together.

00:30:36.149 --> 00:30:38.925
It will appear as if you both
are very committed to the relationship.

00:30:50.331 --> 00:30:52.123
What the hell?

00:30:52.123 --> 00:30:54.688
- What is it?
- Are they crazy?

00:30:55.883 --> 00:30:57.163
It's from Weechana's assistant.

00:30:57.163 --> 00:30:59.175
He sent me your schedule
to support Weechana's campaign.

00:30:59.175 --> 00:31:00.976
Just look at it.

00:31:03.741 --> 00:31:05.672
Are they serious?

00:31:05.672 --> 00:31:08.245
This schedule doesn't give me
enough time to prepare for my role.

00:31:09.349 --> 00:31:12.165
It's okay, I'll talk to them.

00:31:15.115 --> 00:31:17.877
Hello, this is Domino.

00:31:17.877 --> 00:31:21.509
I saw your schedule,
and I don't think it'd work for Eva.

00:31:21.509 --> 00:31:24.965
She also has to prepare for her big project.

00:31:27.365 --> 00:31:28.651
That's not right.

00:31:28.651 --> 00:31:30.957
You also need to check Eva's work schedule.

00:31:30.957 --> 00:31:34.605
Eva's schedule is busier than Pie's.

00:31:36.883 --> 00:31:39.579
I will say this only one last time.

00:31:39.579 --> 00:31:41.725
Eva is too busy for this.

00:31:43.482 --> 00:31:44.877
What did you just say?

00:31:44.877 --> 00:31:47.101
Are you threatening me?

00:31:47.101 --> 00:31:50.507
I don't care.
You can send any kind of picture you want.

00:31:50.507 --> 00:31:52.925
Eva is still too busy for this.

00:31:59.453 --> 00:32:00.940
What's the matter?

00:32:07.592 --> 00:32:10.435
Eva can visit her aunt
while campaigning on the streets.

00:32:10.435 --> 00:32:12.845
Aren't you worried
you might not see her again?

00:32:39.176 --> 00:32:40.568
Hey!

00:32:40.568 --> 00:32:42.805
Did he just threaten me?

00:32:55.597 --> 00:32:57.720
When you were in New York,

00:32:57.720 --> 00:33:01.485
did you work at East 46th Restaurant?

00:33:02.885 --> 00:33:08.325
When you were in New York,
did you work at East 46th Restaurant?

00:33:09.963 --> 00:33:11.893
Yes, I did.

00:33:11.893 --> 00:33:14.005
What a coincidence!

00:33:15.456 --> 00:33:19.165
I've always wanted to try this restaurant.

00:33:20.725 --> 00:33:23.965
What are their signature dishes?

00:33:24.864 --> 00:33:27.459
The Park Avenue Duck.

00:33:27.459 --> 00:33:30.483
Their signature dessert is...

00:33:30.483 --> 00:33:32.808
The Madison Cheesecake.

00:33:32.808 --> 00:33:35.053
Alright.

00:33:35.053 --> 00:33:36.771
That's it.

00:33:36.771 --> 00:33:38.725
It's too bad I didn't get to try any.

00:33:40.275 --> 00:33:44.445
Are you here to ask me about the dishes?

00:33:45.467 --> 00:33:48.845
Actually, I once waited in line
to try this restaurant,

00:33:49.621 --> 00:33:52.101
but I never got to eat there.

00:33:52.101 --> 00:33:54.445
We met there once, remember?

00:33:55.725 --> 00:33:58.560
If you see something
that's none of your business,

00:33:59.435 --> 00:34:01.925
just stay out of it.

00:34:01.925 --> 00:34:04.245
I'll keep it short so you'll understand.

00:34:05.191 --> 00:34:08.365
Because once you cross that line,
you won't be able to come back.

00:34:09.387 --> 00:34:13.421
So make that right and smart choice.

00:34:13.421 --> 00:34:14.889
Yeah?

00:34:18.719 --> 00:34:20.089
Good.

00:34:22.008 --> 00:34:26.285
If I get a chance,
I will try the duck dish you mentioned.

00:34:27.283 --> 00:34:31.805
And I'll visit the restaurant
where your uncle works as a chef.

00:34:32.644 --> 00:34:34.949
He's been cooking his whole life.

00:34:34.949 --> 00:34:36.965
I bet his food is amazing.

00:34:40.176 --> 00:34:42.205
Chinatown, right?

00:34:44.762 --> 00:34:47.341
We're running late for work,
so we need to go.

00:34:47.341 --> 00:34:49.813
Let's go. Come on.

00:34:56.025 --> 00:34:57.719
Be safe.

00:35:15.882 --> 00:35:18.704
Damn! What was that all about?

00:35:18.704 --> 00:35:21.322
Why did he say it
like he was threatening you?

00:35:21.322 --> 00:35:23.797
I saw him with Ginny in New York.

00:35:23.797 --> 00:35:26.664
I wasn't sure at first,
but he looked so familiar.

00:35:26.664 --> 00:35:28.645
When I watched the news with you,
I realized who he was.

00:35:28.645 --> 00:35:30.707
I wasn't planning on telling anyone
about him.

00:35:30.707 --> 00:35:33.176
You didn't even know about it.

00:35:33.176 --> 00:35:36.805
Damn, no wonder.

00:35:36.805 --> 00:35:40.110
Did he know that you saw him?

00:35:40.110 --> 00:35:41.696
I'm not sure.

00:35:41.696 --> 00:35:45.305
But he asked me out of the blue
if I worked there.

00:35:45.305 --> 00:35:47.480
He must have done some digging.

00:35:47.480 --> 00:35:50.325
He also mentioned my uncle's restaurant
in Chinatown.

00:35:52.163 --> 00:35:58.144
I think he might be worried
that you would tell Eva about him.

00:35:58.144 --> 00:36:01.325
What do you think? I'm confused.

00:36:02.494 --> 00:36:04.293
What about this?

00:36:04.293 --> 00:36:06.320
Should I tell Domino that Weechana...

00:36:06.320 --> 00:36:07.725
No, don't do that.

00:36:07.725 --> 00:36:10.147
They are dating, as you said.

00:36:10.147 --> 00:36:11.699
They just got back together.

00:36:11.699 --> 00:36:14.755
We might be in trouble
if we tell her about it.

00:36:14.755 --> 00:36:17.056
If he doesn't cross the line,

00:36:17.056 --> 00:36:19.051
I won't mess with his business.
That's for sure.

00:36:19.051 --> 00:36:22.278
We get the job done, get paid, and that's it.

00:36:22.278 --> 00:36:23.800
Then we move on.

00:36:23.800 --> 00:36:25.064
Are you sure about this?

00:36:25.064 --> 00:36:26.877
Of course.

00:36:26.877 --> 00:36:28.678
I don't want to be in trouble.

00:36:34.890 --> 00:36:37.381
- Hello, Auntie?
- Hi, how are you?

00:36:37.381 --> 00:36:38.944
Did Weechana go to see you?

00:36:38.944 --> 00:36:41.624
That's right. He came to see me.

00:36:41.624 --> 00:36:44.093
So many people asked to take photos with him.

00:36:44.093 --> 00:36:47.325
He didn't know
you wanted to break up with him, right?

00:36:48.600 --> 00:36:50.781
We haven't had a serious conversation
about it yet.

00:36:50.781 --> 00:36:53.786
Listen, if he invites you somewhere,
don't go with him.

00:36:53.786 --> 00:36:55.445
Call me first if he does.

00:36:55.445 --> 00:36:58.365
Why? What's the matter?

00:36:58.365 --> 00:37:00.725
Is everything okay?

00:37:00.725 --> 00:37:02.925
I'll call you later.

00:37:02.925 --> 00:37:04.726
I need to go now.

00:37:09.453 --> 00:37:11.685
He did visit my aunt.

00:37:13.205 --> 00:37:15.325
Why would he do that?